import EnPage from '../../components/EnPage.astro';
---

<EnPage
  title="Support"
  kicker="HELP · LIGOS"
  path="/en/support/"
  description="Get help with Ligos: contact us, connect services, manage your account, billing and privacy requests."
>
  <p class="intro">
    Need help with Ligos? Message us and we will reply as soon as we can. You can also find answers
    to common questions below.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Telegram:</strong>
      <a href="https://t.me/pavel_stoyanov">@pavel_stoyanov</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Your account:</strong>
      <a href="https://app.ligos.io/login">app.ligos.io</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To help us answer faster, tell us which AI client you use (for example ChatGPT or Claude),
    which service you are connecting, what you expected and what happened instead, and any error
    message you saw. Please do not send passwords, API keys or access tokens in a message.
  </p>

  <h2>Documentation</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/podklyuchit/">How to connect Ligos to your AI client</a> — step-by-step guides for ChatGPT, Claude and other clients (Russian)</li>
    <li><a href="/katalog/">Service catalogue and connection guides</a> — instructions for each supported service (Russian)</li>
    <li><a href="/bezopasnost/">Security</a> — how access, keys and permissions work (Russian)</li>
    <li><a href="/voprosy/">Frequently asked questions</a> (Russian)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Getting started</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Sign up or sign in at <a href="https://app.ligos.io/login">app.ligos.io</a>.</li>
    <li>Choose a service from the catalogue and follow its connection guide (see Documentation above).</li>
    <li>Copy your Ligos connection link into your AI client, then ask a question in plain language.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Common questions</h2>
  <h3>The AI cannot see my data</h3>
  <p>
    Check that the service shows as connected in your account, that the API key has not expired or
    been revoked, and that it has the permissions needed for the data you are asking about. Then
    start a new conversation in your AI client and try again. Available data depends on the
    permissions and API methods of each service.
  </p>
  <h3>Can Ligos change my data?</h3>
  <p>
    Ligos connections are read-only unless a service is explicitly described otherwise. Use API
    keys with read-only permissions where the service allows it.
  </p>
  <h3>How do I disconnect a service?</h3>
  <p>
    Remove the connection in your account, and revoke the API key or authorisation in the service
    itself. Revoking stops future access; it does not remove information already delivered to your
    AI provider, which follows that provider’s own policies.
  </p>
  <h3>How do I cancel my subscription or ask for a refund?</h3>
  <p>
    Cancel in your account to stop future charges; access normally continues until the end of the
    paid period. For refund questions, message us with the email of your account and the payment
    date. See the <a href="/en/terms/">Terms of Service</a> for details.
  </p>
  <h3>How do I delete my account or my data?</h3>
  <p>
    Message us from the contact above and we will help. See the
    <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for how we handle requests about personal data.
  </p>
  <h3>I think I found a security problem</h3>
  <p>
    Please message us on Telegram with a short description and steps to reproduce, and do not
    include real secrets. We will look at it promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/en/terms/">Terms of Service</a>
  </p>
</EnPage>
